                                "sense_id": "10d0792e-cfaf-3767-8c1c-ea0e385f5976",
                                "text": "A grim meaning rose in the vacuous eye of Lovel; Isaacs caressed his diamond pin, smiling in a sickly fashion; McNamara's wandering stare fixed and grew unhumanly bright; Ufert openly dropped his hand on his gun-butt and stood sullenly defiant."
